{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 1381, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0b9f0aef8baf0a981432f2ff2e8f8a4f1daf9f2f154f957fa99f16ff0f3f18df7d12f2ff16bfa89f1ccf0b2f0a8f8f4f154f15a8148", "baseline_text": "에리카 군，//왠지 들떠 있는 것 같은데…//무슨 일이라도 있어？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "エリカくん、//なんだかウキウキして……//どうかしたのかい？", "pointer_offset": 1240, "unit": "dialogue:1dda3ad4fd2787b3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 1440, "capacity": 68, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f9d7f2c8f960f1bdf18cf0cff1842f2ff0c6f0f7f0a5f0b8f7d12f2ff2e8f8a4f14ff4ddf14781432f2ff15df15ff984f2bff15af1d0f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨와 함께 싸운다고//생각하니…//왠지 기뻐서，//춤추고 싶어져요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神さんと戦えるかと思うと……//なんだか、うれしくて、//おどりたくなっちゃいます！", "pointer_offset": 1244, "unit": "dialogue:e16c1aead0c34082", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 1523, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abf24781b82f2ff1abf8a3f2aaf240f94bf1e2f0bcf29ef15af0ef8148", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨∈//바로 명령해 주시겠어요？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神さん∈//さっそく命令してくれますか！", "pointer_offset": 1248, "unit": "dialogue:0f74be22c17b06f0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 1564, "capacity": 8, "raw_hex": "f0d8f27ef0a4f7d1", "baseline_text": "그렇지…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そうだな……", "pointer_offset": 1252, "unit": "dialogue:58090deaa978807f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 1577, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f3ddf0a2f8a3f0b1f144f947f1bdf9c9f26581b8", "baseline_text": "앞으로 나가서 싸워 줘∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "前に出て戦ってくれ！", "pointer_offset": 1256, "unit": "dialogue:1a2fe477fe4a1693", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 3112, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f2cef1c5f0b9f947f3f0f244f0a5f0a881b8", "baseline_text": "후방에서 엄호하라∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "後方で援護だ！", "pointer_offset": 1260, "unit": "dialogue:e93ab1981679e17a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 3131, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f0fcf8f3f184f345f8b2f781f166f8e7f293f35cf14b81b8", "baseline_text": "검은 고양이 왈츠를 부탁해∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "黒ネコのワルツを頼む！", "pointer_offset": 1264, "unit": "dialogue:cc2800a6191c2cf5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 1636, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f1cff0af8143f0b9f0aef8baf0a9f7d12f2ff3ddf0a2f8a3f0b1f144f947f1bdf9c9f26581b82f2ff164f2d6f1f7f0b2f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "좋아，에리카 군…//앞으로 나가서 싸워 줘∈//격투전이다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よし、エリカくん……//前に出て戦ってくれ！//格闘戦だ！", "pointer_offset": 1268, "unit": "dialogue:878dac52760789c7", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 1691, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0f08143f362fac6f1e2f1d5f0ef81b82f2ff0b2f18bf8c8f279f14b81432f2ff3eafc64f1dcf3d7f8c8f94bf14cf195f0b8f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "네，맡겨 주세요∈//이날을 위해，//천벌 특훈을 해 왔답니다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "はい、まかせてください∈//この日のために、//天罰の特訓をしてたんです！", "pointer_offset": 1272, "unit": "dialogue:3391fba1f07f95e0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 1762, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f7d1f241f0ad2f2ff8dff177f16bf8e1f192f1e8f7d12f2ff393f15af26cf0aef8dbf28af144f0ef8148", "baseline_text": "…설마//제 광무의 성능…//잊어버리신 건가요？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……って、もしかして//わたしの光武の性能……//忘れちゃったんですか？", "pointer_offset": 1276, "unit": "dialogue:354f590be804ac83", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0011", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 1831, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f253f957f16af1a8f0a5f1c8f0b181432f2ff3bcf0b9f947f0a4f194f0a5f957f0f12f2ff1dcf14ff3b6f0b8f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "저는 회복하거나，//뒤에서 지원하는 게//특기랍니다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "わたしは、回復したり、//後ろから援護したりするのが//得意なんですよ！", "pointer_offset": 1280, "unit": "dialogue:19362e8a21555407", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0012", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 1900, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa62f16ef8b9f0e4f1aef1d9f984f154f0a2f1c781432f2ff3eaf464f8c8f19cf9b2f26cfa7cf1c8f26bf0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "이런 때에 장난치고 있으면，//천벌을 내려 버릴 거예요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "こんなときにふざけてると、//天罰を与えちゃいますからね！", "pointer_offset": 1284, "unit": "dialogue:aa5fea48b739d3a7", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0013", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 1957, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f0ab8143f0abf191f14b81b82f2ff0d8f2ca81432f2ff3bcf0b9f947f3f0f244f94bf26581b8", "baseline_text": "미，미안해∈//그럼，//뒤에서 엄호해 줘∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "す、すまない！//それじゃ、//後ろから援護してくれ∈", "pointer_offset": 1288, "unit": "dialogue:5d59e3a9c6e85ece", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0014", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 2008, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f0f0816081b82f2ff2c9f29ef0cef0b8f0cff0af81b8", "baseline_text": "네～∈//알겠습니다아∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "はーい！//わかりましたぁ∈", "pointer_offset": 1292, "unit": "dialogue:c53497c7af08b427", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0015", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 2035, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0b9f0aef8baf0a9f0f32f2ff2cef9c5f0a4f194f8c8f362f0aff26581b82f2ff14ffaa4f16af1a8f8f4f293f35cf14b81b8", "baseline_text": "에리카 군은//후방 지원을 맡아줘∈//기체 회복도 부탁해∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "エリカくんは//後方からの援護だ！//機体の回復も頼む∈", "pointer_offset": 1296, "unit": "dialogue:d72525e5babf60a5", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0016", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 2088, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f0f08143f2c9f29ef0cef0b8f0cff0af81b82f2ff362f2c6f9d4f1e2f1d5f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "네，알겠습니다아∈//맡겨만 주세요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "はい、わかりましたぁ！//バッチリまかせてください∈", "pointer_offset": 1300, "unit": "dialogue:8a3586109b931708", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0017", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 2139, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f0d8f0b1f253f0b18143f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f7d12f2ff8dff177f16bf8e1f192f1e8f0c881432f2ff14ff396f94bf1e2f246f0a9f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "그나저나，오오가미 씨…//제 광무의 성능을，//기억해 주셨군요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "それにしても、大神さん……//わたしの光武の性能、//覚えててくれたんですね。", "pointer_offset": 1304, "unit": "dialogue:6de0082af436e0b0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0018", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 2214, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f0aff0af8143f1b1f1e7f0b2f0a481442f2ff393f8c8f0aef944f1b5f276f0af8144", "baseline_text": "아아，물론이지．//잊을 리가 없잖아．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ああ、もちろんだよ。//忘れるわけがないだろ。", "pointer_offset": 1308, "unit": "dialogue:a33199c50f16dcf7", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0019", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 2259, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f0b9f372f372f372f7d12f2ff0d8f2ca81432f2ff0b9f0aef0ba8143f1def0b8f0cf816081b8", "baseline_text": "에헤헤헤…//그럼，//에리카，갑니다～∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "エヘヘヘ……//それじゃ、//エリカ、行っきまーす∈", "pointer_offset": 1312, "unit": "dialogue:8d7e267844447b20", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0020", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 2308, "capacity": 66, "raw_hex": "8175f0fcf8f3f184f345f0b2f8e1f781f1668176f8e7f293f35cf1a9f0cf81b8f0ecf8f3f3e5f3ddf0b2f0cff7d12f2ff0aaf782f8c8f387f0aef8a4f0adf0a881b8", "baseline_text": "「검은 고양이의 왈츠」를 부탁한다∈적은 눈앞이다…//스텝을 틀리지 마라∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "「黒ネコのワルツ」を頼む！//敵は目の前だ……//ステップをまちがうなよ！", "pointer_offset": 1316, "unit": "dialogue:0e0602098e8883c7", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0021", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 2379, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f0f0f7d1f1def0b8f0cf81b82f2f8175f9a9f1abff54f0d0f0aff1478143f29c816081b88176", "baseline_text": "네…갑니다∈//「한 바퀴 돌아서，냐～∈」", "kind": "ascr", "source": "はい……いきます！//「一回まわって、ニャ～！」", "pointer_offset": 1320, "unit": "dialogue:b6d5053386106b5a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0022", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 2426, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "8175f8f9fa48f0d0f0aff1478143f0ab816081b88176", "baseline_text": "「두 번 돌아서，미～∈」", "kind": "ascr", "source": "「二回まわって、ミ～！」", "pointer_offset": 1324, "unit": "dialogue:92caec86619052e6", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0023", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 2451, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "f0c38143f0c3f164f9a9f49df27af0b2f0bcf0f0f0eff7d12f2ff16bf0e2f8a3f1b1f28af0c82f2ff155f0a4f8a4f263f8aff1e2f1d58160f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "과，과격한 손님이시네요…//무대로 물건을//던지지 말아 주세～요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "か、過激なお客さんですねぇ……//ステージに物を//投げないでくださ～い！", "pointer_offset": 1328, "unit": "dialogue:41693ee65533c9c3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0024", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 2522, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f15af0a881482f2ff991f1daf0aef957f28af1448148", "baseline_text": "어라？//안 들리는 건가？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あれ？//聞こえてないのかな？", "pointer_offset": 1332, "unit": "dialogue:db8577bf15ed6bd9", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0025", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 2551, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0ab8143f0abf191f14b8143f0b9f0aef8baf0a981442f2ff19cf944f280f281f0ccf15af7d12f2ff0b2f8dff0d8f1d4f94bf26581b8", "baseline_text": "미，미안해，에리카 군．//내가 잘못했어…//이제 그만해 줘∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "す、すまない、エリカくん。//俺が悪かった……//もうやめてくれ∈", "pointer_offset": 1336, "unit": "dialogue:cd8190cf7c4ef970", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0026", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 2614, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f0d8f262f144f0ef81482f2ff0d8f2ca8143f0d8f1d4f257f0f1f0ef81b82f2ff2d9f973f1bef0c7f1ce8143fbf4f349816081b8", "baseline_text": "그런가요？//그럼，그만할게요∈//증귀 여러분，또 봐～∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そうですか？//じゃ、やめときます！//蒸鬼のみなさん、またね～！", "pointer_offset": 1340, "unit": "dialogue:7c55ab2b47321f45", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0027", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 3156, "capacity": 74, "raw_hex": "f0b98143f0b9f0aef8baf0a9f0b9f0f12f2ff3b5f39bf0a5f957fa8af182f481f8c8f2e1f15af148f29ef157f2e1f7d12f2ff0cff2c3f293f0ddf957f14ef36cf14bf148f29ef15a8144", "baseline_text": "에，에리카 군에게//농담하는 건 목숨을 걸어야겠는걸…//다음부터는 조심해야겠어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "エ、エリカくんに//冗談を言うのは、命がけだな……//今度から気をつけよう。", "pointer_offset": 1344, "unit": "dialogue:117b84b8be602562", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0028", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 2750, "capacity": 8, "raw_hex": "8163816381638163", "baseline_text": "…………", "kind": "ascr", "source": "…………", "pointer_offset": 1348, "unit": "dialogue:b5999fb8c439aedc", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0029", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 2759, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abf24781b82f2ff1f7fad6f140f8b9f571f29ff0b2f0a8f0b881432f2ff1d9f0a6f14bf0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨∈//전투 중에 낮잠이라니，//치사해요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神さん！//戦闘中にお昼寝なんて、//ズルイですよ∈", "pointer_offset": 1352, "unit": "dialogue:f2212928479d93e7", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0030", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 2810, "capacity": 66, "raw_hex": "f0af8143f0aff0b88143f0d8f8f1f0aff0b8f0a881442f2ff0b9f0aef8baf0a9f8e1f177f96bf192f1e8f0c82f2ff1f2f2baf0aef984f154f1f3f955f1c8f1488144", "baseline_text": "아，아니，그게 아니라．//에리카 군의 광무 성능을//떠올리고 있었던 거야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "い、いや、ちがうんだ。//エリカくんの光武の性能を//思い出していたんだよ。", "pointer_offset": 1356, "unit": "dialogue:0807a7eb0ec49d22", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0031", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 2883, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f253f94ff263f0b2f2528143f16af1a8f0a5f1c8f0b12f2ff3bcf0b9f947f0a4f194f0a5f957f0f12f2ff1dcf14ff1c8f2c0f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "저기 말이죠，회복하거나//뒤에서 지원하는 게//특기거든요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あのですね、回復したり//後ろから援護したりするのが//得意なんですよ！", "pointer_offset": 1360, "unit": "dialogue:0336d440a1d2ec54", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN#0032", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03009.SBN", "offset": 2952, "capacity": 80, "raw_hex": "f174f0aef0b9f947f2c8f960f1bdf3d2f157f18d81432f2ff393f0a2f0bcf9c7f991f267f0ef81442f2ff18ef263f0b2f0a48143f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f957fa81f263f0e8f0cff0b8f261f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "파리에서 함께 싸웠는데，//잊으시면 안 돼요．//정말이지，오오가미 씨는 못 말린다니까요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "巴里で一緒に戦ったのに、//忘れないでくださいよ。//もぅ、ダメだなぁ、大神さんは。", "pointer_offset": 1364, "unit": "dialogue:7540c4a6f1a88571", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
